                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Just ran this as grand finals in a Mystery tournament and was cry-laughing watching the two teams play and seeing the game go from cutesy puzzle game to one of the teams getting good at tossing the other team off the edge to just all-out blorbo massacre. No game felt like it was too short or too long or too much of a blowout, and what I was afraid would be simple chaos turned out to be a great Bomberman-esque experience.\n\nIt was dubbed the Heihachi Simulator afterward because of how often people got knocked out and dropped off a cliff.",
